   "description": "<p>Added Exclusion list for certain weapon that gets offsetted when performing reload or attaching mods.<br />\nUser can add or remove specific weapons from the list by adding or removing the IDs from ExclusionList.json</p>\n<p>Currently Known weapon that gets offset:</p>\n<p>MP7A1</p>\n<p>AK-74M</p>\n<p>VPO-215 Bolt Action Rifle</p>\n<p>If you saw another weapon having the same issue as the above weapon you can report it <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Choccymiruku/AnimatorUpdater/issues/1\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a></p>\n<p>Thank you to Arys and CJ for helping out on the issue.</p>\n",
